    <string name="settings_about_version">filt3r %1$s</string>
    <string name="settings_about_protection">For the strongest protection, turn on Always-on VPN and Block connections without VPN for filt3r in Android Settings &gt; Network &gt; VPN. Only one VPN can run at a time: filt3r replaces any other.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_license">filt3r is free software, GPL version 2 or later, built on PersonalDNSFilter. The APK is conveyed under GPL version 3 because it includes Material Components (Apache License 2.0). It also includes hev-socks5-tunnel (MIT), lwIP (BSD 3-clause) and libyaml (MIT). Source code: https://github.com/jairjacom/filt3r</string>
